<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/145.0.0.0 Safari/537.36" version="29.6.0">
  <diagram name="Page-1" id="kVsMZYtDvONQvtEPgMtW">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1429" dy="758" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1169" pageHeight="1654" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="&lt;div style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 1em 0in; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The Computational Cell Biology (CCB) Workshop will begin in two weeks, on Monday, March 16, at 11:00 AM EST. Each daily session will last 2-4 hours (&lt;a href=&quot;https://compcellbio.org/ccbworkshop&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://compcellbio.org/ccbworkshop&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1772723188260000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2zASZjKAOQroz-MQjUlR9c&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(17, 85, 204);&quot;&gt;https://compcellbio.org/&lt;wbr&gt;ccbworkshop&lt;/a&gt;). A Zoom link and detailed instructions will be sent a few days before the workshop.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 1em 0in; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;To ensure a smooth experience, please download and install the following software in advance and familiarize yourself with them: COPASI (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(70, 120, 134);&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;m_1618967435538240836OWA2502f48e-cddb-34b6-b2a6-eb3d1ca98037&quot; href=&quot;http://copasi.org/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://copasi.org&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1772723188260000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3zT3HrO7QFptB8zx33VpzW&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(70, 120, 134);&quot;&gt;http://copasi.org&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;), Virtual Cell (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(70, 120, 134);&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;m_1618967435538240836OWAe9e17863-23c7-ab5a-aada-1c13f6ac70d1&quot; href=&quot;http://vcell.org/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://vcell.org&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1772723188260000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3zaKYxiI8qOYldo7phSOsp&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(70, 120, 134);&quot;&gt;http://vcell.org&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;), and SpringSaLaD (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(70, 120, 134);&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;m_1618967435538240836OWAf7ffd2f4-5330-9309-b22e-021d176f76e1&quot; href=&quot;https://vcell.org/ssalad&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://vcell.org/ssalad&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1772723188260000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3JHNV1BGmMnzs-iH5ZHt9R&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(70, 120, 134);&quot;&gt;https://vcell.org/ssalad&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;). This workshop will not include an extended tutorial on software installation or setup. To maximize your learning experience, you are encouraged to watch relevant YouTube videos from previous workshops:&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(70, 120, 134);&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;m_1618967435538240836OWA5590e249-3343-eeb8-f1ed-989a8b9f303f&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@compcellbiol8898&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.youtube.com/@compcellbiol8898&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1772723188260000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3t3IY0Il5wMBvCY7awGjeK&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(70, 120, 134);&quot;&gt;https://www.youtube.com/@&lt;wbr&gt;compcellbiol8898&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 1em 0in; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Attendance is free. However,&amp;nbsp;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;the project track is&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;intended to help you to&amp;nbsp;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;develop your own projects&lt;/b&gt;. Participants in the project track will be&amp;nbsp;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;required to give a short presentation about their project on the first day&lt;/b&gt;. For example, rather than stating “I am interested in modeling signaling,” you should specify: “I will model receptor signaling pathway ABC, which involves interactions among molecules X, Y, and Z. I have the following data (e.g. concentrations of X, Y at several doses of Z) and aim to find out whether X and Y bind directly or through an intermediate”.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Sending us a brief description in advance is required to help you and us to determine whether your project is suitable for the project track&lt;/b&gt;.&amp;nbsp;Check examples of past modeling projects that led to publications at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://vcell.org/vcell-published-models&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://vcell.org/vcell-published-models&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1772723188260000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3zbeI7ERh1en7jz_nb7DZl&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(17, 85, 204);&quot;&gt;https://vcell.org/vcell-&lt;wbr&gt;published-models&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://copasi.org/Research/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://copasi.org/Research/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1772723188260000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3yLPH-ZGGs4gqFx7CxJ2yL&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(17, 85, 204);&quot;&gt;https://copasi.org/Research/&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" link="&lt;div style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 1em 0in; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;The Computational Cell Biology (CCB) Workshop will begin in two weeks, on Monday, March 16, at 11:00 AM EST. Each daily session will last 2-4 hours (&lt;a href=&quot;https://compcellbio.org/ccbworkshop&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://compcellbio.org/ccbworkshop&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1772723188260000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2zASZjKAOQroz-MQjUlR9c&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(17, 85, 204);&quot;&gt;https://compcellbio.org/&lt;wbr&gt;ccbworkshop&lt;/a&gt;). A Zoom link and detailed instructions will be sent a few days before the workshop.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 1em 0in; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;To ensure a smooth experience, please download and install the following software in advance and familiarize yourself with them: COPASI (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(70, 120, 134);&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;m_1618967435538240836OWA2502f48e-cddb-34b6-b2a6-eb3d1ca98037&quot; href=&quot;http://copasi.org/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://copasi.org&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1772723188260000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3zT3HrO7QFptB8zx33VpzW&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(70, 120, 134);&quot;&gt;http://copasi.org&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;), Virtual Cell (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(70, 120, 134);&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;m_1618967435538240836OWAe9e17863-23c7-ab5a-aada-1c13f6ac70d1&quot; href=&quot;http://vcell.org/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://vcell.org&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1772723188260000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3zaKYxiI8qOYldo7phSOsp&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(70, 120, 134);&quot;&gt;http://vcell.org&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;), and SpringSaLaD (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(70, 120, 134);&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;m_1618967435538240836OWAf7ffd2f4-5330-9309-b22e-021d176f76e1&quot; href=&quot;https://vcell.org/ssalad&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://vcell.org/ssalad&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1772723188260000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3JHNV1BGmMnzs-iH5ZHt9R&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(70, 120, 134);&quot;&gt;https://vcell.org/ssalad&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;). This workshop will not include an extended tutorial on software installation or setup. To maximize your learning experience, you are encouraged to watch relevant YouTube videos from previous workshops:&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(70, 120, 134);&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;m_1618967435538240836OWA5590e249-3343-eeb8-f1ed-989a8b9f303f&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@compcellbiol8898&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.youtube.com/@compcellbiol8898&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1772723188260000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3t3IY0Il5wMBvCY7awGjeK&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(70, 120, 134);&quot;&gt;https://www.youtube.com/@&lt;wbr&gt;compcellbiol8898&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin: 1em 0in; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Attendance is free. However,&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;the project track is&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;intended to help you to&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;develop your own projects&lt;/b&gt;. Participants in the project track will be&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;required to give a short presentation about their project on the first day&lt;/b&gt;. For example, rather than stating “I am interested in modeling signaling,” you should specify: “I will model receptor signaling pathway ABC, which involves interactions among molecules X, Y, and Z. I have the following data (e.g. concentrations of X, Y at several doses of Z) and aim to find out whether X and Y bind directly or through an intermediate”.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sending us a brief description in advance is required to help you and us to determine whether your project is suitable for the project track&lt;/b&gt;.&amp;nbsp;Check examples of past modeling projects that led to publications at&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://vcell.org/vcell-published-models&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://vcell.org/vcell-published-models&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1772723188260000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3zbeI7ERh1en7jz_nb7DZl&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(17, 85, 204);&quot;&gt;https://vcell.org/vcell-&lt;wbr&gt;published-models&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://copasi.org/Research/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://copasi.org/Research/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1772723188260000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3yLPH-ZGGs4gqFx7CxJ2yL&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(17, 85, 204);&quot;&gt;https://copasi.org/Research/&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;" id="KM3lQNd7yXq531_yeUCX-1">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="510" width="610" x="10" y="20" as="geometry" />
